# Sectigo (Comodo) AAA Certificate Services, the root that cross-signed the
# eMudhra intermediates above. Mozilla no longer trusts it (current Debian
# 20250419 and Ubuntu 20260816 bundles do not hold it), but older bundles
# still do (Ubuntu 20.04 in hyperledger/fabric-tools 2.5.6, pip's vendored
# certifi in python:3.12-bookworm), so the cross-signed copies would chain to
# it there. Current Sectigo chains end at the USERTrust roots, which stay.
d7a7a0fb5d7e2731d771e9484ebcdef71d5f0c3e0a2948782bc83ee0ea699ef4 root comodo-aaa-certificate-services.pem crt.sh/?id=331986 AAA Certificate Services (issuer: AAA Certificate Services)
